# API key setup

When using the YouTubeTranscript.dev API from this project:

1. Get an API key at https://youtubetranscript.dev/dashboard
2. Store it as `YOUTUBE_TRANSCRIPT_API_KEY` in `.env.local` or environment
3. Never commit API keys to version control
4. Use `Authorization: Bearer <key>` for API requests
